<title>USA: American CinemaStores names Van Ness CEO.</title>
<headline>American CinemaStores names Van Ness CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>American CinemaStores Inc said Wednesday it has named Kathy Van Ness president and chief executive officer, replacing interim president Chistopher Ebert.</p>
<p>The company said Ebert will continue as chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
